Collection: Test
Description: Basic smoke test for Post requests

---

Name: getPosts
Request:
GET http://localhost:8000

Query:
userId: 1

Headers:
Accept: application/json
X-Env: {{tenantId}}

Tests:
- status is 200
- header content-type contains json
- json.path length greaterThan 0
- json.path any(id equals 1)
- json.path filter(userId equals 1) count greaterThan 0
